Files: macoswebproto/*.svelte macoswebproto/apps-config.ts macoswebproto/apps.svelte.ts
Copyright: Puru Vijay
License: MIT
Comment:
 The web prototype the magnification curve and its easing were derived from,
 kept in tree as the reference the C++ constants are checked against.
 https://github.com/PuruVJ/macos-web

Files: macoswebproto/third_party/lucid-tokens/*
Copyright: 2026 Javid Medina
License: LGPL-2.1+
Comment:
 The LucidOS configuration model, compiled into this binary rather than linked
 as a shared library. Deliberately LGPL-2.1+ while the dock is GPL-3+: the dock
 is an end-user program that nothing links, and the resolver is the piece that
 is only worth anything if other projects adopt it. LGPL-2.1+ is compatible with
 the GPL, so the combined work is distributable under the GPL-3+ covering the
 dock, while the resolver on its own remains adoptable by projects that are not
 GPL.

Files: macoswebproto/protocols/*
Copyright: 2018 Ilia Bozhinov
           2018 Purism SPC
           and the wlroots and wayland-protocols contributors
License: MIT
Comment:
 Wayland protocol descriptions, vendored rather than build-depended on:
 wlr-protocols is not packaged on Debian or Ubuntu, and pinning the XML means
 the generated marshalling code cannot change underneath a build.

